2:T1568,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"LocalBusiness","@id":"https://techmedicsmacon.com/#business","name":"Tech Medics Macon","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":"4.9","bestRating":"5","worstRating":"1","ratingCount":"18","reviewCount":"18"},"review":[{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sarah M."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Cracked my iPhone 16 screen at work and they fixed it in 25 minutes. Screen looks perfect — can't even tell it was broken. Best iPhone repair in Macon."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"James T."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"My iPhone 15 battery was dying by lunch every day. They swapped it in 30 minutes and now it lasts all day. Way cheaper than Apple."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Emily R."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Dropped my iPhone in the pool and thought it was done. Tech Medics recovered it and saved all my photos. Miracle workers!"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Marcus D."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Dropped my iPhone 15 face-down on the parking lot. They had the screen replaced in 25 minutes and it looks brand new. Saved me hundreds compared to Apple!"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Angela W."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"My daughter cracked her iPad screen. Tech Medics fixed it same day for way less than I expected. Great service and very friendly."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"David L."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"MacBook Pro screen cracked in my bag. They replaced the Retina display and it's perfect. Best repair shop in Macon hands down."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Tyler R."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"PS5 had no video output – HDMI port was damaged. Tech Medics soldered a new one and it works perfectly. Way cheaper than buying a new PS5!"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Patricia K."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"My MacBook Air wouldn't hold a charge for more than an hour. New battery installed same day and it's back to lasting 10+ hours. Lifesaver!"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Christina M."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"My iPhone 14 would only charge if I held the cable at a weird angle. They replaced the charging port in 40 minutes and now it works perfectly."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Brandon K."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Both my Joy-Cons had terrible drift. They fixed both in about an hour and now they're perfect. Great price and fast service."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jennifer P."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"My iPhone was completely dead after water damage. Tech Medics recovered ALL my photos – 5 years of memories I thought were gone forever. Worth every penny."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Michael S."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Spilled coffee all over my MacBook Pro. They cleaned it up, replaced a couple of damaged components, and it works perfectly now. Saved me thousands."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Robert H."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"My daughter's iPad battery was swollen and the screen was lifting. They replaced it safely within the hour. Very professional and affordable."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Kevin B."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Thought my iPad was dead but it was just the charging port. Tech Medics fixed it same day and saved me from buying a new one. Great price too."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Lisa G."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"MacBook Pro wouldn't charge at all. They diagnosed it quickly and had it fixed within 2 hours. Professional service and fair pricing."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Daniel M."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"MacBook hard drive failed with years of work documents. They recovered everything. I was in tears. These guys are the real deal."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Amanda C."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Dropped my phone and the screen was totally black. Couldn't access anything. Tech Medics pulled all my contacts, photos, and messages off it."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jason W."},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":"5","bestRating":"5"},"reviewBody":"Xbox Series X wouldn't read discs anymore. They replaced the disc drive and it's back to normal. Friendly staff and reasonable pricing."}]}0:{"buildId":"6lxoE0A5jLvmc5f3uGGzF","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://techmedicsmacon.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Macon\",\"item\":\"https://techmedicsmacon.com/macon\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Reviews\",\"item\":